{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01074","headline":"相和歌辞 采桑 · 刘希夷","name":"相和歌辞 采桑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杨柳送行人，青青西入秦。\n秦家采桑女，楼上不胜春。\n盈盈灞水曲，步步春芳绿。\n红脸耀明珠，绦唇含白玉。\n回首渭桥东，遥怜树色同。\n青丝娇落日，缃绮弄春风。\n携笼长叹息，逶迤恋春色。\n看花若有情，倚树疑无力。\n薄暮思悠悠，使君南陌头。\n相逢不相识，归去梦青楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘希夷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}